# Netlify serves the built files directly, so a request for /dashboard looks for a
# file at that path, finds nothing, and 404s. This hands every unmatched path to
# index.html and lets react-router resolve it client-side.
#
# Status 200, not 301: a redirect would change the URL in the address bar, and a
# judge sharing a deep link to /recommendations should land on /recommendations.
/backend/intake/session https://jansetu-api.onrender.com/intake/session 200!
/backend/intake/session/revoke https://jansetu-api.onrender.com/intake/session/revoke 200!
/*  /index.html  200
